              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Kitopoloo EJAKAIT Yosua kapaaran kaŋin kakonyen nuka Isirael kere; koyoŋata ŋes apaarasia kere nuka aijarake, kwape ayoŋitotor Musa.",
          "type": "text",
